      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The base rate/reference class is the same national monthly total series: May rose by 0.067 million year over year in 2024 and 0.131 million in 2025, while the latest 2026 level is materially below March 2025. I therefore use the recent 2026 level and the historical March-to-May pattern rather than extrapolating the earlier annual acceleration."
